# ---- Experiment outputs ----
# Strategy: ignore run dirs at the directory level to block bulk-adds,
# but whitelist specific per-run files for LFS tracking.
# Git cannot un-ignore files inside an ignored directory via ! rules,
# so we must NOT ignore the runs/ dir itself — only its unlisted contents.
05_results/runs/**
!05_results/runs/
!05_results/runs/*/
!05_results/runs/README.md
!05_results/runs/*/inference_log.csv
!05_results/runs/*/telemetry_raw.csv
!05_results/runs/*/run_metadata.json
!05_results/runs/*/run_metadata.partial.json
!05_results/runs/*/metadata.json
!05_results/runs/*/telemetry_derived.csv
!05_results/runs/*/scheduler_decisions.csv
!05_results/runs/*/state_vector_log.csv


